           "description": {
            "musicDescriptionShelfRenderer": {
             "description": {
              "runs": [
               {
                "text": "Are We There Yet? is the ninth studio album by the English singer and songwriter Rick Astley, released on 13 October 2023 by BMG. It was preceded by the lead single \"Dippin My Feet\" and the single \"Never Gonna Stop\". Astley toured the UK, Ireland and Europe in support of the album from November 2023 to March 2024. The album is Astley's first of new music since Beautiful Life. It peaked at No. 2 on the UK Albums Chart. It is Astley's first album to not have a picture of himself as the cover.\n\nFrom Wikipedia ("
               },
